# Cloudflare Pages redirects — 301 map for pages removed from the docs site.
#
# GSC was reporting 404s for URLs Google still had indexed from before the
# deletions (article slugs renamed/pruned in the SEO/i18n cleanup, old ranui
# component names, ranuts utils that moved or were removed). Every deleted page
# 301s to the closest surviving page so link equity passes instead of dying,
# and the 404 list in Search Console drains as Google re-crawls.
#
# First match wins — keep the catch-all `.html` rule LAST.
#
# ── Articles (all pruned article slugs → the surviving flagship article) ──────
/src/article/design_mode /src/article/doc_preview 301
